Upstream-Name: Northstar
Upstream-Contact: Andreas Røsdal <andreas.rosdal@gmail.com>
Source: https://github.com/nordstjernen-web/northstar-web-browser
Files-Excluded:
 data/render-tests/assets/wiki-*
 data/render-tests/assets/wikipedia-*.css
 data/render-tests/realworld-wikipedia*.html
Comment:
 Northstar Web Browser is the GPL edition of the Nordstjernen
 project. The browser engine is original C written from scratch; it is not
 a fork of Gecko, WebKit, or Blink.
 .
 The orig tarball is repacked (+ds): it adds the lexbor and quickjs-ng
 meson subprojects, which meson would otherwise download at configure time,
 and drops render-test fixtures copied from Wikipedia (the Wikipedia logos
 and stylesheets), which are not needed for the build and whose licensing
 is not DFSG-compatible. See debian/README.source.

